      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Simplify $\\cos(x-30^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$. Enter signed coefficients.\n\n{{field-1}} $\\sin x-$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$",
